<title>USA: Key Energy to acquire Texas trucking firm.</title>
<headline>Key Energy to acquire Texas trucking firm.</headline>
<dateline>EAST BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Key Energy Group Inc on Tuesday said it has signed a letter of intent to acquire TST Paraffin Service Co, for about $8.7 million.</p>
<p>Based in Brownfield, Texas, TST provides trucking, fluid transportation, storage and disposal and related services for oil and gas producers in the Northern Permian Basin of West Texas. TST had revenues of approximately $9.4 million in the year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Key Energy anticipates closing the TST acquisition prior to April 4, 1997.</p>
